  "name": "Expiring Inventory Lots",
  "description": "Helps the warehouse operations manager to retrieves on-hand inventory lots for a specified inventory organization whose expiration dates fall within a date range beginning today, enabling warehouse and inventory teams to identify lots expiring in the coming days. Start Date, End Date and default OrganizationId are the required inputs",
